    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29916" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕβδομος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑπτά</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>seventh</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				19.117
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἑβδόμη</span>
